    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d513-a1">

                <pb facs="0649" n="335" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg335"/>


                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The British Secretary of State for Foreign Affairs</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Grey</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the British Minister in
                        Denmark</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Lowther</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1914-10-31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 31, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>It is essential to have immediate answer respecting Platuria and Knudsen as I am
                    receiving constant and urgent complaints from United States Government against
                    delay in dealing with these ships. If you cannot obtain desired guarantees
                    report exactly how the case stands.</p>
                <p rendition="#right">[File copy not signed]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
